@lang en
IMPORT `homecare-part3`

-- The hostile reading: one demonstration per finding in NOTES.md section 4 that the encoding
-- can show. Each assertion states the SURPRISING answer the text gives, and passes; a finding
-- is a defect in the instrument, not in the encoding. Summary figures are the HYPOTHETICAL
-- ones of homecare-test-fixtures.l4.

§ `Findings`

§§ `X-negligence: Part 2 exclusion 1 removes negligence`

-- "hành động cố ý hoặc chểnh mảng" (an intentional OR NEGLIGENT act) whose consequences
-- could reasonably have been foreseen. Foreseeable harm from carelessness is the ordinary
-- shape of liability in negligence, which is what a personal liability cover is for.
