-- src:535 | huống của hành động cố ý hoặc chểnh mảng đã nêu.
-- A guest trips on a loose stair rug the Insured carelessly left, a foreseeable injury.
GIVETH A `A Part 2 claim`
`a guest trips on a rug the Insured left loose` MEANS
    `a visitor injured with` (LIST `a negligent act of the Insured or a Family member`, `the consequences were reasonably foreseeable from the act`)

