§§ `X-vacancy: three different vacancy rules`

-- Peril 6(b) excludes escape of water to a Home that is vacant at all; Peril 9(d) excludes
-- theft only after more than 30 consecutive days unattended; GC3(d) ends cover only after more
-- than 30 days vacant. A family away for three days loses water cover and keeps the rest.
