#ASSERT elem (`an Insured Peril ground` `Peril 9: the Home is not enclosed by walls or fences`) (`the grounds on which a Part 1 claim fails, under` (`the owner's policy, at` (`The insured premises` WITH `the kind of building` IS `an apartment in an apartment building`, `at the address in the Policy Summary` IS TRUE, `the Insured's principal personal residence` IS TRUE, `used wholly or mainly as the Insured's private residence` IS TRUE, `part used as an office` IS FALSE, `office use approved by the authorities` IS FALSE, `used for a trade or business other than an office` IS FALSE, `walls of concrete, brick or stone` IS TRUE, `roof of concrete, tiles, slate or incombustible metal sheet` IS TRUE, `under construction` IS FALSE, `being demolished or vacant pending demolition` IS FALSE, `a temporary building or structure` IS FALSE, `enclosed by walls or fences` IS FALSE, `some part is lent, let or sublet` IS FALSE, `some part is used to manufacture, deposit or store goods` IS FALSE)) `with` `good conduct` `for` (`a sofa damaged by` `theft or attempted theft` `with` (LIST `force or violence used to enter`)) `, as at` `1 April 2026`)

§§ `X-sublimit: the tenant's 160,000,000 can sit above the Part 2 limit`

-- The Extension's sub-limit is printed; the Part 2 limit is the Summary's. With a Summary
-- limit of 100,000,000 per Occurrence (hypothetical), the printed 160,000,000 never binds.
-- src:514 | Trách nhiệm của người thuê nhà, Giới hạn 160.000.000 Đồng cho mỗi Sự Cố
#ASSERT `Part 2: the amount payable, under` (`a policy with` (`The Policy Summary` WITH `the Period of Insurance begins` IS YMD 2026 1 1, `the Period of Insurance ends` IS YMD 2026 12 31, `the sum insured on the Home` IS NOTHING, `the sum insured on the Renovation Costs` IS NOTHING, `the sum insured on the Contents` IS JUST 300_000_000, `the Part 1 Limit of Liability` IS NOTHING, `the Part 2 Limit of Liability for any one Occurrence` IS JUST 100_000_000, `the Part 2 Limit of Liability for the Period` IS JUST 200_000_000, `the Part 2 limit for food and drink` IS NOTHING, `the Part 1 Deductible` IS NOTHING, `the Part 2 Deductible` IS NOTHING, `the Part 3 Deductible` IS NOTHING, `the Insured is named under Part 3` IS FALSE, `the domestic helper benefit is named` IS FALSE, `the construction of the Home is specially provided for` IS FALSE, `the annual premium` IS 1_000_000) `, insured` (`an Insured born 15 June 1980, a tenant` TRUE) `, premises` (`premises that are a` `an apartment in an apartment building`)) `with` `good conduct` `for` (`a liability of` `the Insured named in the Policy Summary` `for` (LIST `physical damage to or destruction of tangible property`) `to` NOTHING `and` (JUST (`A third party's property` WITH `owned or controlled by the Insured, the Family or a resident` IS TRUE, `belonging to an employee of the Insured` IS FALSE, `the Insured Location or its fixtures, rented by the Insured` IS TRUE)) `with` EMPTY `, decided by` `a first-instance judgment of a competent Vietnamese court`) `on` (`Part 2 figures: damages` 200_000_000 `, costs recovered` 0 `, consented costs` 0 `, paid earlier` 0) `, as at` `1 April 2026` EQUALS 100_000_000
